  "prefLabel": "Inst 702.20 Stabilizing devices",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Inst 702.20 “Stabilizing devices” means all components of the anchoring and support system such as piers, footing, ties, anchoring equipment, ground anchors, or any other materials and methods of construction which supports and secures the manufactured house to the ground.\n\nSource. #14221, eff 2-25-25",
